# datanika-landing — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env (gitignored) for local development. CI reads these from
# GitHub Actions secrets.
#
# There are currently NO build-time variables. `npm run build` produces the
# production bytes with no secrets at all, which is why the Build step in
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml carries no `env:` block.
#
# `PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_CONVERSION_LABEL` used to live here. It was removed with the
# Google Ads tag in landing#481: /privacy section 8 states that this site sets no
# third-party advertising cookies, and the tag contradicted that on 101 of 165
# built pages. Do not re-add it on its own - the legal pages have to change in the
# same commit, and tests/no-advertising-tag.test.ts enforces that.
